{"id":"645673","name":"酸辣米粉","author":"小洞天","authorId":"126119","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/645673/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米粉","amount":"150g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"油菜","amount":"1颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"米粉放入锅中煮8分钟左右。","img":"images/645673/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"捞出冲洗几遍。","img":"images/645673/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"沥干水分。","img":"images/645673/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"整个鸡蛋煎好盛出备用。","img":"images/645673/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中放一小块火锅底料化开。","img":"images/645673/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量开水。放适量盐和鸡精调味。","img":"images/645673/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入适量油菜。","img":"images/645673/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"待油菜煮至断生，放入米粉。","img":"images/645673/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入煎好的荷包蛋。","img":"images/645673/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"淋少许陈醋。","img":"images/645673/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/645673/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}